===Etymology===
{{suffix|gather|alt1=to gather|er|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who [[gather]]s things.
# A person who [[collect]]s [[rent]] or [[tax]]es.
# {{context|textiles|lang=en}} An attachment to a sewing machine for making gathers in the cloth.

